"M6N1RDxe, M6N1RDye, M6N1RDze, M6N2RDxe, M6N2RDye, M6N2RDze" 		 - MB1 rotations
"M6N1FKxe, M6N1FKye, M6N1FKze, M6N2FKxe, M6N2FKye, M6N2FKze" 		 - MB1 static (elastic) forces
"M6N1MKxe, M6N1MKye, M6N1MKze, M6N2MKxe, M6N2MKye, M6N2MKze" 		 - MB1 static (elastic) moments
"M7N1TDxss, M7N1TDyss, M7N1TDzss, M7N2TDxss, M7N2TDyss, M7N2TDzss" 		 - MB2 displacements
"M7N1RDxe, M7N1RDye, M7N1RDze, M7N2RDxe, M7N2RDye, M7N2RDze" 		 - MB2 rotations
"M7N1FKxe, M7N1FKye, M7N1FKze, M7N2FKxe, M7N2FKye, M7N2FKze" 		 - MB2 static (elastic) forces
"M7N1MKxe, M7N1MKye, M7N1MKze, M7N2MKxe, M7N2MKye, M7N2MKze" 		 - MB2 static (elastic) moments
"IntfFXss, IntfFYss, IntfFZss, IntfMXss, IntfMYss, IntfMZss" 		 - Interface joint moments and forces.
"IntfTDXss, IntfTDYss, IntfTDZss, IntfRDXss, IntfRDYss , IntfRDZss" 		 - Displacements and rotations of the TP reference point in global coordinate sys.
"IntfTAXss, IntfTAYss, IntfTAZss, IntfRAXss, IntfRAYss, IntfRAZss" 		 - Translational and rotational accelerations of the TP reference point (platform reference point) location in SS coordinate system
